## Third-party components

This application bundles third-party software that remains under its own
licence; the MIT licence above applies only to this application's own source.

### Stockfish

`assets/engine/stockfish-18-lite-single.js` and
`assets/engine/stockfish-18-lite-single.wasm` are a build of Stockfish 18
(Lite, single-threaded, WebAssembly), distributed under the **GNU General
Public License v3.0**.

    Stockfish - https://github.com/official-stockfish/Stockfish
    Copyright (C) 2004-2026 the Stockfish developers
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

The complete corresponding source for Stockfish is available at the URL above.
Stockfish is a separate program invoked by this application through a
message-passing interface; it is not linked into this application's own code.

### Stockfish.js

The Emscripten loader is emitted by Stockfish.js, licensed **GPLv3**.

    Stockfish.js - https://github.com/nmrugg/stockfish.js
    Copyright (c) Chess.com, LLC

### Other dependencies

React Native, Expo and the remaining npm dependencies are used under their
respective licences; see `package.json` and the upstream projects for details.
